["sleeping", 80.26, 80.56], ["cleaner.", 80.56, 80.96], ["90", 81.26, 81.46], ["-day", 81.46, 81.7], ["money", 81.7, 81.92], ["-back", 81.92, 82.14], ["guarantee,", 82.14, 82.64], ["link", 82.9, 83.1], ["below.", 83.1, 83.38]], "segments": [[0.0, 4.94, "I could sleep anywhere and breathe fine. A hotel, my daughter's guest room, the recliner."], [5.3, 10.68, "Then I'd get back in my own bed, and by 3 a.m., one side of my nose was shut. For years, I blamed"], [10.68, 15.6, "allergies. But allergies don't wait for you to get home. If it's always the lower nostril,"], [15.86, 20.02, "the side you're lying on, that's not pollen. Pollen doesn't care which side you sleep on."], [20.24, 24.18, "If it switches sides when you roll over, that's not just your sinuses. That's the"], [24.18, 27.76, "trigger that follows your face around the pillow. And if it clears within minutes of"], [27.76, 31.92, "standing up, and it's gone a week you sleep somewhere else, then nobody's telling you this."], [32.2, 35.76, "The problem never leaves your bed. It's the most common thing living in a mattress,"], [36.28, 40.66, "just mites. A colony of a hundred thousand to ten million of them, deep in the fibers,"], [41.04, 45.54, "feeding on the skin you shed every night, right there, inches from your face, for eight hours"], [45.54, 49.78, "a night. And the worst part, your bedroom can look spotless, because none of this is in the"], [49.78, 55.26, "room. It's inside the mattress, where no wash, spray, or vacuum ever reaches. But here's"], [55.26, 60.42, "actually fixes this. Capture cards. Most mite products try to kill them. This one pulls them out."], [60.68, 65.46, "A plant-derived pheromone lure draws the mites up out of the deep fibers. The adhesive locks them"], [65.46, 70.12, "on the card, so what it catches comes out of your bed instead of back into it. Slide one under"], [70.12, 74.28, "the mattress, one near the pillow, and let them work. The colony comes out of the mattress."], [74.64, 79.38, "The card shows you how much. And one card keeps going for about three months. Over 30,000"], [79.38, 83.38, "homes are already sleeping cleaner. 90-day money-back guarantee, link below."]]}